 install` probe quickly from a real terminal and report [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]registration, exit codes, and closers honestly — so epic bob-cli-3j[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]can land.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]shell_completion_landing_fixes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/shell_completion_landing_fixes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/bob_shell_completion.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-3j.9[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-3j/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-3j.9.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Completion results, bash insertion, and capture-grammar [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]integration[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]results[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]results: make body-bearing @route: follow capture-complete's new-ID [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]intent, honor ValueHints and positional file slots, fix the stale [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-complete TEXT hint, make the bash adapter insert correctly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]across = wordbreaks, open quotes, spaces, and attached !files-in, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add goldens and docs for the =x/=*/=! capture changes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Honest, fast bob completion lifecycle[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lifecycle[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lifecycle: run shell probes in their own session so they never stall [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]under a terminal,